                        "sense_id": "6586e93d-50b4-3b57-a3f3-e5a497f8ab50",
                        "entry_id": "bb911f82-8509-30de-83b4-b88584117ad1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The qualities of being venerable; great age, respectability, infirmity, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4c89ef8-a849-47b1-ba97-85b265060fbd",
                                "sense_id": "6586e93d-50b4-3b57-a3f3-e5a497f8ab50",
                                "text": "Because of the professor's venerability his opinion was often asked, but his actual attendance in committee meetings was not insisted upon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8714b97c-c5d3-488e-9dfc-35817be59afd",
                                "sense_id": "6586e93d-50b4-3b57-a3f3-e5a497f8ab50",
                                "text": "The far-flungness of the word, the phenomenological pleasure of finding it variously transformed by Ransom's modernity and Beowulf’s venerability made me feel vaguely something for which again I only found the words years later."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
